The patch modifies device dispatch, accelerator synchronization, precision
contexts, non-CUDA fallback selection, rank-eight image patchification, command
help, and associated tests for an Ascend 910 / TorchNPU eager-inference baseline.
Modified files carry General-AI-Compiler change notices and retain their upstream
SPDX and copyright headers. This patch does not distribute model
weights, datasets, credentials, or robot-control assets.

The companion tools/galaxeavla/g05_* optimization adapters also target this
pinned source. They add reversible graph execution, AE attention/normalization/
RoPE substitutions, fixed time and vision geometry constants, context-only
encoding, and an experimental GatedDeltaNet inverse. These adapters do not
relicense the underlying G0.5 materials. Adapted Qwen/Hugging Face components
retain their upstream attribution and third-party license references in the
source files. Benchmark evidence is separate from model weights and datasets.

